5. Rust crates
--------------

keymux is built from crates.io dependencies under their own licenses
(permissive ones such as MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib, plus MPL-2.0 for
`colored` and `option-ext`). They are not copied into this repository; see
`cargo metadata` for the list. At the time of the switch every license
expression found was checked to allow use in a GPL-3.0-or-later program.
